# Checked permutation tables for the J₂ placement words

Evaluate the exact words of `Seed.s`, `Seed.q₂`, and all 72 placement
representatives in the checked ATLAS generating pair. Packed tables make these
pointwise kernel computations small; both inverse laws and equality to the
actual carrier permutations are proved. Representative numbering is unchanged.

The representative tables come from `../source/double-cosets.json`; generator
tables are computed from the words in `ExceptionalParabolics.Seed`. All data
serve only as witnesses for the finite proofs below.
Source: Aschbacher–Smith, proof of 1.3.4, printed p.511/PDF p.528, and GLS3
Table 5.3g; original ATLAS data and attribution accompany the carrier.
-/

